1 NAME Andreas /Rönnow/
2 GIVN Andreas
2 _MARNM Rönnow
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1693
2 ADDR
3 CITY Välluv
3 STAE Skåne County
3 POST 253 51
3 CTRY Sweden
