1 OCCU Prokureur, notaris en akteuitmaker
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Die Pieter Woutersen grafkelder aan die bopunt van Wesselsstraat in Seepunt het in 1857 in besit gekom van Jacobus Christoffel Wessels van Ganzekraal want hy was getroud met die kleindogter van Pieter Woutersen.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------
2 CONT
2 CONT Bought farm Matjieskuil (formerly known as Waarburg farm), near Klapmuts, dist. Stellenbosch: Purchased from Petrus Johannes Schabort. Together with his brother Daniel H. W. Wessels and brother-in-law Petrus J. Redelinghuys
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT
2 CONT Owned farm Joostenberg (formerly known as Weltevreden farm), near Klapmuts, dist. Stellenbosch. Sold to his brother Johannes Wilhelmus Wessels. 
2 CONT
2 CONT -------
2 CONT
2 CONT Bought his aunt's husband's (Petrus J. Reedelinghuys †1848) share of Matjieskuil, (formerly known as Waarburg farm), near Klapmuts, dist Stellenbosch in 1847.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sold his 2/3 share ownership in Matjieskuil to his brother Daniel Hendrik Wilhelm Wessels in 1848.
2 CONT
2 CONT ---------
2 CONT
