2 DATE 9 JUL 1822
2 PLAC Joostenburg farm, near Klapmuts
2 ADDR
3 CITY Stellenbosch
3 STAE Cape Colony
3 CTRY South Africa
1 DEAT
2 DATE 9 APR 1900
2 PLAC The home of his daughter
