2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Spår? PRIMROSE. Henry Primrose, Major of Infantry [son of John Primrose, otherwise  Primeroos, a merchant in Stockholm], having proved his descent, was ENNOBLED  [Sweden No. 640] by Queen Christina 1653. He d. s.p.m. 1669.
2 CONT
