2 CONT * Children:	Hans Flyborg, Jonas Flyborg, Ingrid Chatarina Scharling (born Flyborg), Andreas Flyborg, Maria Christina Gertzen (born Flyborg), Andreas Flyborg, Carl Magnus Flyborg
