1 NOTE {geni:about_me} OBITUARY: Farmer Sven Olofsson in Djupsjö, born in 1700 on May 16. Father, the deceased farmer Olof Johansson ibid. and mother Margareta Svensdotter In 1720 he received the homestead after his father's death and in
2 CONC  the same year he entered into marriage with his former deceased wife Barbro Nilsdotter with whom he lived together for 36 years, fathered 12 children, 6 + 6, of which 3 sons and 2 daughters still live. his walk was quiet and piou
2 CONC s. He was in good health until 9 days before his death he had to take up bed. Buried on 20 May 1782, lived 82 years 4 d.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nordmaling: AI:1 s 8, 27, 57 
2 CONT
