1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Lambertus Morkel was a speculator in the Kroonstad - Bothaville area, Orange Free State. He was married to Maria Magdalena Louw. They having several children, born and baptized at Kroonstad. He died at Bothaville 2
2 CONC 0 August 1921 TAB  MHG 5345/50 1921  It is however strange that I found his death notice at the Pretoria Archives, (Transvaal) yet it clearly states that he died at Bothaville, (Orange Free State), and he is buried at Bothaville o
2 CONC ld town cemetery, where I placed the broken headstone pieces together to make out his name. 
1 FAMC @F6000000026938570827@
1 FAMS @F6000000053587105837@
1 RFN geni:6000000053587105833
1 SUBM @S6000000013055771690@
