2 FORM jpg
2 _PRIM Y
2 NOTE Lambertus Petrus Dirk Morkel grave at the old cemetery at Bothville town, Orange Free State which I took earlier this month during Nampo Harvest festival. Thank to Dalene for your assistance, in finding the exact spot, as many gra
3 CONC ves are either vandalized, or just broken, in a cemetery not respected by the municipality. 
