1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Incorrect in SAG. Magdalena could not have married Jacobus Groenewald on 19 November 1750. She was only baptised on 4 September 1757. Under Jacobus Groenewald in SAG it shows that she married him on 18 November 178
2 CONC 0. Their first child was baptised on 2 October 1781. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The folllowing information is also incorrect in SAG. She was not married to Johannes (Jacobus) GROENEWALD ≈ Stellenbosch 23.11.1760 s.v. Christoffel Groenewald en Elisabeth Minnaar.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was married in Paarl 18.11.1780 to Jacobus Groenewald = 28.3.1734 son of Christoffel Groenewald and Anna Hasselaar. This can be seen by the family members that witnessed the baptisms of all their children.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''b11 Daniel''' ≈ Paarl 9.10.1707, burger Drakenstein x Paarl 27.4.1732 Sara HANEKOM ≈ 2.12.1714 † c. 1741 d.v. Jurgen Hanekom en Johanna van den Bosch xx Paarl 15.9.1743 Maria LE RICHE * c. 1717 † c. 1749 d.v. Louis le Riche en 
2 CONC Suzanne Fouche xxx Paarl 9.5.1751 Magdalena SENEKAL * c. 1718 † c. 1790 d.v. David Senekal en Anne Madeleine du Puy
2 CONT
2 CONT '''c15 Magdalena''' ≈ 4.9.1757 † “Joostenberg”, dist. Stellenbosch 26.6.1840 x Paarl 18.11.1780 Jacobus GROENEWALD
