2 CONC delborg, and elder brother Johan Borgh, ennobled and adopted Adelborg, in the order in which they are mentioned here). Lieutenant 1776-05-22. Captain 1782-02-20. Died 1787-04-16 in Loviisa, Finland. He served in the regimental cha
2 CONC nge in 1772 and was therefore knighted. Buried in Pernaja Church, Finland
