1 NOTE kom från Kallhögen, 
2 CONT Johan was a boatswain(båtsman), but was sick and quit the army and then he moved to Vilhelmina and settled in
2 CONT Strömnäs . He drowned in Lake Dojnan. His widow annd children moved back to Bjurholm.
2 CONT (ÅB) Kommer från Kallhögen, Vänäs 1832 - till Bjurholm 1836.
